---

## Step 13: Detect Suspicious Web Requests

Execute:

```bash id="n8q6vm"
grep "404" /var/log/apache2/access.log
```

Observation:

* Failed web requests (404 errors) are displayed.

Inference:

* Multiple 404 requests may indicate scanning or probing attacks.

